<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questDescription->A nearby settlement, [settlement_label], has a special trade request. They would like to purchase:\n\n  [requestedThingCount]x [requestedThing_label] [qualityInfo](worth [requestedThingMarketValue_money])\n\nIf you want to make the trade, send a caravan with the requested items. The estimated travel time is [estimatedTravelTime_duration].</li>
    <li>qualityInfo(requestedThingHasQuality==True,priority=1)->of normal+ quality </li>
    <li>qualityInfo-></li>
  -->
  <TradeRequest.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>&lt;li&gt;questDescription-&gt; Um acordo próximo, [settlement_label], tem um pedido de comércio especial. Eles gostariam de comprar:\n\n[pedido de ThingCount]x [requestedThing_label] [qualityInfo](worth [requestedThingMarketValue_money])]\n\nSe você quiser fazer o comércio, envie uma caravana com os itens solicitados. O tempo estimado de viagem é [estimadoTravelTime_duration].&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;qualityInfo(requestedThingHasQuality==True,priority=1)-&gt; da qualidade normal+ &lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;qualityInfo-&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n</TradeRequest.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
